Run Demand Intelligence from the repository root.

Terminal 1 — forecasting API:
python -m uvicorn app:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000

Terminal 2 — Streamlit dashboard:
python -m streamlit run dashboard.py

Open the dashboard URL printed by Streamlit (normally http://localhost:8501).
The dashboard navigation provides separate overview, forecasting, inventory,
SKU registry, portfolio, analytics, and reports/bulk-operation workspaces.

The database currently stores sales transactions and product/category metadata.
Inventory balances, purchase orders, and external notification delivery are
not connected; replenishment quantities are recommendations based on the stock
assumptions entered for a planning run.